/result
/result-*
/.direnv/
/target

# An agent's own state, which lives in the checkout because that is where the
# tool keeps it: settings, the persist loop's bookkeeping, and scratch
# worktrees that are whole git repositories of their own. None of it is
# project content, and the worktrees commit as gitlinks nobody else can
# resolve. Ignored rather than remembered, because `git add -A` is one keypress
# away from carrying all of it into a commit.
/.claude/
